WEBVTT

00:00:53.835 --> 00:01:00.835
But I want you to think about what it is
that leads to that statement

00:01:00.859 --> 00:01:02.875
on the third word,

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:05.376
because the third word

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:10.238
is a description of your sex.

00:01:13.159 --> 00:01:15.548
And by that I mean,

00:01:15.572 --> 00:01:19.071
made by a description of your genitals.

00:01:20.436 --> 00:01:23.480
Now, as a pediatric endocrinologist,

00:01:23.504 --> 00:01:28.981
I used to be very, very involved
and still somewhat am, in cases

00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:35.269
in which there are mismatches
in the externals